[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0010","text":"『………………』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0020","text":"『再见了……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0030","text":"果穗，最后一场戏演得很好哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0040","text":"真的吗！？　太好了！\n一直一直都很开心──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0050","text":"一想到就要结束了，\n开心和不舍的心情就涌了上来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0060","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0070","text":"我在想，我演的那个孩子是不是也想任性地说\n“想再多待在一起”呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0080","text":"嗯，是啊\n那种拼命忍住的心情，我感受到了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0090","text":"好！　作为坚持到最后的奖励，\n果穗的任性要求，我满足你一个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0100","text":"什么都可以……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0110","text":"嗯，只要是我能做到的都可以"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0120","text":"──！\n我想好了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0130","text":"哦，要什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0140","text":"────嘿嘿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_03_0150","text":"『有本事就来抓住我呀！』"}]
